{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909870/extras/8d97a60869f97cf737791572366cf630.avif?t=1770544790\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Legacy</strong> is a cooperative survival game in the horror genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 1990, a curse fell upon our hometown. Our grandfather \u2014 a local molfar and magician \u2014 according to a sinister tradition, once every 66 years, was supposed to sacrifice one of his descendants to the dark forest forces. But he couldn\u2019t do it. Instead, he sent me, my two brothers, and my sister to Kyiv to protect us from the curse. He saved our lives but doomed the city and its surroundings to death and destruction...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years passed. We became adults and built our own lives, but the memory of Svetlograd tormented our hearts. During one family dinner, we made a decision: to return there and end the darkness forever, to free the city and give people the chance to live again. Each of us has unique skills, strengths, and weaknesses \u2014 together, we complement each other perfectly. Having gathered some equipment, we went there... to face our destiny.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909870/extras/69874cc2e440118bb2375d4f52f9236f.poster.avif?t=1770544790\" width=600 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909870/extras/69874cc2e440118bb2375d4f52f9236f.webm?t=1770544790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909870/extras/69874cc2e440118bb2375d4f52f9236f.mp4?t=1770544790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Legacy, there is a detailed survival system. Your character needs food and water, while the cold autumn climate of the Carpathian Mountains forces you to build fires, move around to stay warm, or find shelter at night. Your stamina depends on which character you\u2019ve chosen and how full your backpack is. A bottle of energy drink can help you temporarily avoid stamina problems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you run out of food and there\u2019s no gas station or other source nearby, you can catch and cook a carp or hunt a wild animal to roast its meat over a fire, in an oven, or in a cauldron. Don\u2019t forget about mushrooms and apples either.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Potions, Magic and Mysticism</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909870/extras/a05f93fca1cdc105e7ef5ef72e506c55.poster.avif?t=1770544790\" width=600 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909870/extras/a05f93fca1cdc105e7ef5ef72e506c55.webm?t=1770544790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909870/extras/a05f93fca1cdc105e7ef5ef72e506c55.mp4?t=1770544790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Svetlograd is not just a city, and the nearby settlements are not simple villages. Many local legends tell of mysticism, dark and light magic, and mythical beings \u2014 meaning that the people here are far from ordinary. In The Legacy, you\u2019ll find recipes for magic potions, information about dark entities and how to fight them, and ancient rituals. Collect herbs, mushrooms, and other ingredients. Learn the local mythology and fight evil either with guns and bullets or through rituals and potions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Large Open World and Diverse Locations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909870/extras/9d1d057724113315e5c88c882782b2f6.poster.avif?t=1770544790\" width=600 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909870/extras/9d1d057724113315e5c88c882782b2f6.webm?t=1770544790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909870/extras/9d1d057724113315e5c88c882782b2f6.mp4?t=1770544790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a large open world to explore while completing quests and struggling to survive. While exploring, you\u2019ll find notes from local residents telling mystical stories about Svetlograd and its surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you start a new game, all game items \u2014 such as food, weapons, ammo, book pages, enemies, plants, mushrooms, and animals \u2014 appear in random places. This ensures that every playthrough feels truly new and unpredictable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Construction, Resource Gathering and Crafting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909870/extras/174d0744fd3687de82827dd96b0d3f45.poster.avif?t=1770544790\" width=600 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909870/extras/174d0744fd3687de82827dd96b0d3f45.webm?t=1770544790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909870/extras/174d0744fd3687de82827dd96b0d3f45.mp4?t=1770544790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With tools like an axe or a knife, you can gather resources. If you don\u2019t have tools, try breaking sticks with your bare hands \u2014 but be careful, as you can easily cut yourself and will need bandages. The materials you collect can be used to craft various items or to build your own house, base, or camp. In a team, construction goes faster: one player gathers resources, another builds, while the third lights a fire and cooks food \u2014 so after setting up camp, you can enjoy a meal and regain your strength before new adventures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Play solo or in teams of up to 4 players;<br></li><li> Encounter and fight against a variety of mythical creatures;<br></li><li> A large and dangerous open world;<br></li><li> Hunt animals and fish;<br></li><li> Each mythical creature has unique attacks and behaviors;<br></li><li> Level up unique badges;<br></li><li> Play across 100+ servers simultaneously, thanks to an advanced save system \u2014 with friends or strangers;<br></li><li> Voice and text chat support;<br></li><li> Choose a unique avatar from a wide list of available options;<br></li><li> Build your own base or camp from gathered materials;<br></li><li> Experience the mystical atmosphere of Western Ukraine and the abandoned city of Svetlograd;<br></li><li> Detailed survival mechanics \u2014 your character gets wet if you stay in the rain for too long and freezes faster until you warm up by the fire or dry off. Hunger, thirst, temperature, stamina, blood loss, infections, curses, brewing potions to heal or remove curses, and much more;<br></li><li> Numerous crafting recipes;<br></li><li> Collect ingredients and potion recipes, perform rituals to banish dark forces;<br></li><li> Go boating, fishing, hunting, cooking by the fire or in the oven, helping others, sharing resources, and exploring a vast world together;<br></li><li> Every new playthrough randomizes loot and enemies \u2014 creatures may appear differently; in one game there may be 3, in another 5;<br></li><li> Start the game with basic equipment and weak weapons, but through exploration, discover advanced weapons, encounter military NPCs with AI, or find secret bunkers containing rare gear \u2014 but be careful\u2026 inside the bunker...;</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"POACHER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2909870/1483a92eda72f64e719e175ffb466476637c7dc1.jpg"},{"name":"THREE SURVIVORS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2909870/ed99faf954aada538565f33632556501951bc686.jpg"},{"name":"FRUIT LOVER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2909870/c5d8cb92aeba818b433134000a3973d56f369d8c.jpg"},{"name":"BUILDER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2909870/653190ffee344d76ef68b7ddbcae4264b92a8c9f.jpg"},{"name":"FISHERMAN","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2909870/1e09aaf0a2da382994deb7e1939b7fa47aef5c76.jpg"},{"name":"PROFESSIONAL FISHERMAN","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2909870/232eff8343beb0deeb3a6d6152e6a836a4cec453.jpg"},{"name":"FIRST HUNT","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2909870/63bda52e70e09b71c416daeee2894a4ed2cf6fe9.jpg"},{"name":"AN EXPERIENCED HUNTER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2909870/5603b89c646e22760f0f2beebb14be82957da537.jpg"},{"name":"PROFESSIONAL HUNTER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2909870/3a455b8a7fdcce75e15f583a869bc4c442e92833.jpg"},{"name":"SHOOTER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2909870/0e55965f6516128db836b447d551c5ebc7a0d828.jpg"}],"total":47},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebac