 destruction...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years passed. We became adults and built our own lives, but the memory of Svetlograd tormented our hearts. During one family dinner, we made a decision: to return there and end the darkness forever, to free the city and give people the chance to live again. Each of us has unique skills, strengths, and weaknesses \u2014 together, we complement each other perfectly. Having gathered some equipment, we went there... to face our destiny.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909870/extras/69874cc2e440118bb2375d4f52f9236f.poster.avif?t=1770544790\" width=600 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909870/extras/69874cc2e440118bb2375d4f52f9236f.webm?t=1770544790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909870/extras/69874cc2e440118bb2375d4f52f9236f.mp4?t=1770544790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Legacy, there is a detailed survival system. Your character needs food and water, while the cold autumn climate of the Carpathian Mountains forces you to build fires, move around to stay warm, or find shelter at night. Your stamina depends on which character you\u2019ve chosen and how full your backpack is. A bottle of energy drink can help you temporarily avoid stamina problems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you run out of food and there\u2019s no gas station or other source nearby, you can catch and cook a carp or hunt a wild animal to roast its meat over a fire, in an oven, or in a cauldron. Don\u2019t forget about mushrooms and apples either.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Potions, Magic and Mysticism</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\"