al residents telling mystical stories about Svetlograd and its surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you start a new game, all game items \u2014 such as food, weapons, ammo, book pages, enemies, plants, mushrooms, and animals \u2014 appear in random places. This ensures that every playthrough feels truly new and unpredictable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Construction, Resource Gathering and Crafting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909870/extras/174d0744fd3687de82827dd96b0d3f45.poster.avif?t=1770544790\" width=600 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909870/extras/174d0744fd3687de82827dd96b0d3f45.webm?t=1770544790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909870/extras/174d0744fd3687de82827dd96b0d3f45.mp4?t=1770544790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With tools like an axe or a knife, you can gather resources. If you don\u2019t have tools, try breaking sticks with your bare hands \u2014 but be careful, as you can easily cut yourself and will need bandages. The materials you collect can be used to craft various items or to build your own house, base, or camp. In a team, construction goes faster: one player gathers resources, another builds, while the third lights a fire and cooks food \u2014 so after setting up camp, you can enjoy a meal and regain your strength before new adventures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Play solo or in teams of up to 4 players;<br></li><li> Encounter and fight against a variety of mythical creatures;<br></li><li> A large and dangerous open world;<br></li><li> Hunt animals and fish;<br></li><li> Each mythical creature has unique attacks and behaviors;<br></li><li> Level up unique badges;<br></li><li> Play across 100+ servers simultaneously, thanks to an advanced save system \u2014 with friends or strangers;<br></li><li> Voice and text chat support;<br></li><li> Choose a unique avatar from a wide list of available options;<br></li><li> Build your own base or camp from gathered materials;<br></li><li> Experience the mystical atmosphere of Western Ukraine and the abandoned city of Svetlograd;<br></li><li> Detailed survival mechanics \u2014 your character gets wet if you stay in the rain for too long and freezes faster until you warm up by the fire or dry off. Hunger, thirst, temperature, stamina, blood loss, infections, curses, brewing potions to heal or remove curses, and much more;<br></li><li> Numerous crafting recipes;<br></li><li> Collect ingredients and potion recipes, perform rituals to banish dark forces;<br></li><li> Go boating, fishing, hunting, cooking by the fire or in the oven, helping others, sharing resources, and exploring a vast world together;<br></li><li> Every new playthrough randomizes loot and enemies \u2014 creatures may appear differently; in one game there may be 3, in another 5;<br></li><li> Start the game with basic equipment and weak weapons, but through exploration, discover advanced weapons, encounter military NPCs with AI, or find secret bunkers containing rare gear \u2014 but be careful\u2026 inside the bunker...;</li></ul>","developers":["Second Reality"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909870/9aa98b7d5780257d0e928835edbd266a031dcb90/header.jpg?t=1770544790","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2909870/1124627171/e82381c5638b635d1a5ad925b3f03233fda97efe/1760349314/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760350799","dash_h264":"